name lua-tinyyaml
category Package
revision 73671
shortdesc A tiny YAML (subset) parser in pure Lua
longdesc This package provides a YAML (subset) parser written in pure
longdesc Lua. It supports a subset of the YAML 1.2 specifications. It is
longdesc required by several other LuaTeX packages including markdown
longdesc and citeproc-lua.
